{"id":"81b8ea42a64cc934","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-substitution-proof.md","title":"Substitution in Proofs","display":"df-substitution-proof — Substitution in Proofs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-substitution-proof","aliases":["72-df-substitution-proof"],"display":"df-substitution-proof — Substitution in Proofs","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-substitution]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.1.1 print5/PDF17; local proof-substitution bridge","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-substitution-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-substitution-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-proof — Substitution in Proofs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b10d8a757ca4190e\" href=\"?note=b10d8a757ca4190e\" title=\"72-df-proof-substitution\">72-df-proof-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.1.1 print5/PDF17; local proof-substitution bridge"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是一个固定零元关系原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 是固定公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 为把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 替为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 的给定公式替换在相继式上的作用，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是其规则见证作用，两者满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b10d8a757ca4190e\" href=\"?note=b10d8a757ca4190e\" title=\"72-df-proof-substitution\">72-df-proof-substitution</a> 的明确闭包条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为该演算有限证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi[p:=\\psi;\\tau]:=\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau],\\qquad\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi[p:=\\psi;\\tau])=\\sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi[p:=\\psi;\\tau]:=\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau],\\qquad\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi[p:=\\psi;\\tau])=\\sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是带明确见证变换的兼容记号，避免旧式把命题字母和对象变量或裸公式替换混在一起。只对已给定合法σ,τ使用；不会用一个未定义的capture-avoiding词语补足新函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b10d8a757ca4190e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b10d8a757ca4190e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p$ 是一个固定零元关系原子，$\\psi$ 是固定公式；$\\sigma$ 为把 $p$ 替为 $\\psi$ 的给定公式替换在相继式上的作用，$\\tau$ 是其规则见证作用，两者满足 [[72-df-proof-substitution]] 的明确闭包条件。$\\pi$ 为该演算有限证明。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi[p:=\\psi;\\tau]:=\\pi[\\sigma,\\tau],\\qquad\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi[p:=\\psi;\\tau])=\\sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).","display":true}],"bytes":1278,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-substitution-proof|df-substitution-proof — Substitution in Proofs]]"}],"outgoing":["b10d8a757ca4190e"]}